FIND_ABOUT_TEXT = Find -- instant file search in the spirit of FSearch.\n\nThe folders are indexed once into a database kept in memory; every query searches that database as you type. Use File > Update Database after files changed.\n\nIndexed folders, exclusions and search defaults are in the Settings tool (wish client --run conf).
FIND_SYNTAX_TEXT = Terms separated by spaces must all match. OR (or |) between two terms: either one. !term or NOT term: must not match. "quoted text": one literal term.\n\nA term matches anywhere in the name; with * or ? it is a wildcard matching the whole name (*.txt, IMG_????.jpg). A term with / searches the full path. Case is ignored unless Match Case is on or the query has an upper-case letter.\n\next:jpg;png  files with these extensions\nfile:  folder:  only files / folders (folder:src)\nsize:>10mb  size:1k..2m  file size\ndm:today  dm:thisweek  dm:2026-01-31  dm:>2026-01-01  date modified\npath:  case:  nocase:  exact:  regex:  modify the next term\n\nWith Regular Expression on, the whole query is one regular expression.
